#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"1. <strong>Launch the Campaign</strong>: Create a Project called <em>Stop "
"Child\n"
"                Labor</em> and add key tasks like “Create awareness "
"materials” and “Reach out to\n"
"            schools and local authorities”."
msgstr ""
"1. <strong>Začnite kampanjo</strong>: Ustvarite projekt z imenom <em>"
"Ustavimo otroško\n"
"                delo</em> in dodajte ključne naloge, kot sta “Izdelava "
"gradiv za ozaveščanje” in “Vzpostavljanje stikov s\n"
"            šolami in lokalnimi oblastmi”."

#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"2. <strong>Publish Donation &amp; Petition Forms</strong>: Use the Website "
"to embed a\n"
"            donation form and a petition urging policy changes."
msgstr ""
"2. <strong>Objavite obrazce za donacije in peticije</strong>: S spletnim "
"mestom vdelajte\n"
"            obrazec za donacije in peticijo, ki poziva k spremembam politike."

#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model:event.event,name:non_profit_organization.event_event_4
#, fuzzy
msgid "2025 Annual General Assembly"
msgstr "Letna skupščina 2025"

#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"3. <strong>Organize Awareness Events</strong>: Schedule events like "
"<em>Community\n"
"                Talks</em> or <em>Film Screenings</em> using Events."
msgstr ""
"3. <strong>Organizirajte ozaveščevalne dogodke</strong>: Načrtujte dogodke, "
"kot so <em>pogovori v skupnosti\n"
"                </em> ali <em>filmske projekcije</em>, z uporabo dogodkov."

#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"4. <strong>Involve Volunteers</strong>: Create volunteer roles in Employees "
"and assign\n"
"            shifts using Planning."
msgstr ""
"4. <strong>Vključite prostovoljce</strong>: Ustvarite vloge prostovoljcev v "
"aplikaciji Zaposleni in dodelite\n"
"            izmene z uporabo aplikacije Načrtovanje."

#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"5.<strong> Sell Campaign Merchandise</strong>: Offer items like a <em>“Stop "
"Child\n"
"                Labor” badge</em> via eCommerce, and manage orders and "
"payments online."
msgstr ""
"5.<strong> Prodaja promocijskega blaga kampanje</strong>: Ponudite izdelke, "
"kot je <em>značka »Ustavimo otroško\n"
"                delo«</em>, prek e-trgovine ter upravljajte naročila in "
"plačila prek spleta."

#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"6. <strong>Track Costs</strong>: Log campaign-related expenses in Expenses, "
"linked to the\n"
"            project."
msgstr ""
"6. <strong>Spremljajte stroške</strong>: V aplikaciji Stroški beležite "
"stroške, povezane s kampanjo, in jih povežite s\n"
"            projektom."

#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"7. <strong>Send Attestations</strong>: Generate and sign donation "
"attestations using\n"
"            Donations and Sign, then send to supporters and authorities at "
"the end of the year."
msgstr ""
"7. <strong>Pošiljanje potrdil</strong>: Ustvarite in podpišite potrdila o "
"donacijah z uporabo\n"
"            aplikacij Donacije in Podpis, nato jih ob koncu leta pošljite "
"podpornikom in pristojnim organom."

#. module: non_profit_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:non_profit_organization.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"8. <strong>Keep Supporters Engaged</strong>: Use Email Marketing to send "
"updates and\n"
"            thank-you messages to donors and petition signers."
msgstr ""
"8. <strong>Ohranite zavzetost podpornikov</strong>: Uporabite e-poštno "
"trženje za pošiljanje novic in\n"
"            zahvalnih sporočil donatorjem in podpisnikom peticij."

